# 🧵 Jhagra Textile & Clothing — Atelier Ledger

An elegant, lightweight Tkinter desktop application for managing garment tailoring orders, customer measurement cards, staff allocations, order finances, and live shop floor execution metrics.

Built with a **soft-glassmorphism** design system: frosted-tint cards, soft borders, a light-catching top edge on every card, and a blue/white/red accent strip, in both a Light and a Dark theme, with an intuitive sidebar navigation layout.

---

## ✨ Features

* **Soft-Glass UI**: frosted-tint cards, subtle borders, and a blue/white/red brand accent strip.
* **📊 Analytics Dashboard**: donut gauges for Work Done / In Progress / Remaining, plus a Paid / Remaining / Debt finance snapshot.
* **💰 Finance**: All / Done / Due filter tabs and an Add Payment form, backed by a local SQLite ledger (`finance.db`) mirrored from the orders spreadsheet.
* **🧠 Remembers your settings**: theme, language, last open section, and window size persist across restarts.
* **👤 Customer Hub**: contact profiles, address, and measurement cards (length, chest, waist, ...).
* **📋 Staff & Task Allocation**: roles, duty status, and tasks linked to real orders.
* **⚙️ Settings**: theme, language, garment types, and employee roles in one screen.
* **⏰ Real-time Header Clock**.

